-- =============================================================================
-- Project_B isolated IAM navigation: full menu snapshot (90 rows)
--
-- Purpose
--   Rebuild the exact navigation state used by the isolated demo
--   (8 APP / 15 DIRECTORY rows / 67 PAGE rows, 48 visible pages, 7 formal).
--
-- Why a snapshot instead of replaying batches
--   The historical E17/E18/E20/E21 scripts are incremental UPDATEs against the
--   then-current state. They cannot rebuild 48 visible pages from an empty
--   database. This file is a full state snapshot exported read-only from the
--   running isolated database `iam_sys_demo_lw_20261015_191500_e4f5a6b7`
--   (schema `iam`) on 2026-10-20.
--
-- Prerequisites
--   006-navigation-schema.sql      (tables, constraints, hierarchy trigger)
--   007-navigation-seed-batch1.sql (app metadata + 7 formal pages)
--   Target database created with DBCOMPATIBILITY 'PG' (see below).
--
-- Target database requirement
--   CREATE DATABASE <name> WITH DBCOMPATIBILITY 'PG' TEMPLATE template0;
--   openGauss A-compatibility mode stores '' as NULL, which breaks the
--   NOT NULL DEFAULT '' columns used throughout this schema.
--
-- Safety
--   - Idempotent: INSERT ... SELECT ... WHERE NOT EXISTS per row.
--   - No DROP / TRUNCATE / DELETE.
--   - No user accounts, credentials, business data, or internal IP addresses.
--   - ISOLATED demo database only. Never run against a shared business DB.
--
-- Statement order
--   APP -> DIRECTORY (level 2 -> 3) -> PAGE (level 2 -> 3), sorted by parent.
--   The 006 trigger rejects a child whose parent row does not exist yet.
--
-- Root normalisation
--   Root rows in the live database store parent_stable_menu_key = '' while
--   chk_iam_nav_menu_root_parent_v2 requires NULL for APP rows. Roots are
--   emitted with NULL here.
--
-- Expected result after applying (asserted at the end of this file)
--   total rows .............................. 90
--   nav_eligible = 1 (formal pages) .........  7
--   menu_kind = 'APP' .......................  8
--   menu_kind = 'DIRECTORY' ................. 15
--   menu_kind = 'PAGE' AND visible = 1 ...... 48
--   BATCH_EMCS_HIDE_20261020 AND visible = 0  16
-- =============================================================================

SET search_path TO iam, public;
BEGIN;

